# Build-context exclusions for the pinned evaluator image.
#
# Measured 2026-09-23: `COPY hub/` picks up untracked `hub/**/__pycache__`
# from a working tree (33 entries, gitignored, invisible in `git status`).
# The image then differs from the one a CLEAN checkout builds — different
# config digest for the same source (8ca8ac95… with bytecode, ef02f38a…
# without) — so the recorded identity is unreproducible and a local rebuild
# can never be compared to it. Excluding it makes the context match what CI
# builds: tracked source only.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
